# Hospital admission.
#
# Register the patient, then verify identity. Rejecting the identity check rejects
# the admission: nothing recovers, so triage and disposition are cancelled.
# Acuity is read from instance data. Critical sends the clinician, the admission
# decision and the ward round to the EmergencyDoctor. Anything else uses the
# WardDoctor.
# Complete the admission decision with "admit" to assign a bed and record the
# ward round. Complete it with "discharge" to give discharge advice instead.
# Any other outcome cancels both of those branches.
#
# Roles are the participant role strings. CHECK_ID calls IdentityVerificationService.

DEFINITION
HOSP_ADMIT|Hospital Admission|1

WORKITEMS
process|ADMISSION|-|Hospital Admission
process|INTAKE|ADMISSION|Patient Intake
task|REGISTER|INTAKE|Register Patient
task|CHECK_ID|INTAKE|Verify Patient Identity
process|TRIAGE|ADMISSION|Triage
task|ASSESS_ACUITY|TRIAGE|Assess Acuity
task|ASSIGN_CLINICIAN|TRIAGE|Assign Clinician
process|DISPOSITION|ADMISSION|Disposition
task|ADMIT_DECISION|DISPOSITION|Admission Decision
task|ASSIGN_BED|DISPOSITION|Assign Bed
task|WARD_ROUND|DISPOSITION|Record Ward Round
task|DISCHARGE|DISPOSITION|Discharge Advice

DEPENDENCIES
REGISTER|CHECK_ID|*
INTAKE|TRIAGE|*
ASSESS_ACUITY|ASSIGN_CLINICIAN|*
TRIAGE|DISPOSITION|*
ADMIT_DECISION|ASSIGN_BED|admit
ASSIGN_BED|WARD_ROUND|*
ADMIT_DECISION|DISCHARGE|discharge

ROUTING
REGISTER|role|AdmissionsClerk
CHECK_ID|role|AdmissionsClerk
ASSESS_ACUITY|role|TriageNurse
ASSIGN_CLINICIAN|data|acuity|WardDoctor|Critical|EmergencyDoctor
ADMIT_DECISION|data|acuity|WardDoctor|Critical|EmergencyDoctor
ASSIGN_BED|role|BedManager
WARD_ROUND|data|acuity|WardDoctor|Critical|EmergencyDoctor
DISCHARGE|data|acuity|WardDoctor|Critical|EmergencyDoctor

SERVICES
service|CHECK_ID|IdentityVerificationService

EXTRAS
checkpoint|CHECK_ID
priority|ASSESS_ACUITY|2
audit|ADMIT_DECISION
deadline|ADMIT_DECISION|4
